  "all_ingredients_flat": "baking potato, broccoli, spinach, garlic cloves, ginger, Chaat Masala, Amchoor (raw mango powder), besan (chickpea flour), water, Ezekiel 4:9 Bread",
  "instructions": "(1) PATTTIES: Blend the following ingredients in a food processor to form a dough: 1 large baking potato \u2014 boiled & mashed, 1 cup steamed broccoli (or your favorite veggies), 1 handful spinach (or our favorite leafy greens), 2 garlic cloves, 1 small piece of ginger, Chaat Masala (to taste), Amchoor (raw mango powder \u2014 to taste). Make patties using the dough (I used a mason jar lid as my mould to form the patties). Keep them in the refrigerator for 30 mins to let them cool & slightly harden. (2) BESAN PASTE: Combine besan (chickpea flour) and water for coating the patties. (3) BREAD CRUMBS: Bread apart 2 slices of Ezekiel 4:9 Bread to make bread crumbs. (4) AIR FRYING: Coat the PATTTIES with the BESAN PASTE. Then coat them with BREAD CRUMBS. Place them on parchment paper and air fry till golden brown. It took me 20 mins in the air fryer.",
  "cooking_methods": [
    "blend",
    "boil",
    "steam",
    "no-cook",
    "air-fry"
  ],
  "serving_suggestion": "With chutneys of your choice, or with fruit & salad (as shown in pic).",
  "notes": "A recipe with BEANS (besan | chickpea flour), TUBERS (baking potato), LEAFY GREENS (spinach | our favorite leafy greens), RAINBOW VEGGIES (broccoli | our favorite rainbow veggies), HERBS & SPICES (various).",
